# Credentials

Commands needing credentials run through the `secure_run` MCP tool (CLI:
`secure-run`). Secrets are referenced by name; values are never available here
and output comes back with them replaced by `«SECRET:ref»`.

```
secure_run(cmd=["ansible-playbook", "site.yml", "--limit", "routers"],
           env_refs={"ROUTER_PW": "secret://home/router/admin"})
```

`list_secret_refs` lists available names. The broker executes only committed
work from `/srv/ansible-ctrl` — commit, then `secure_sync`, then run.
